  "scope": "Uniform balanced-row families have actual original-Gamma positioning and inverse-centre maps, whole-family horizontal translations with VF Jacobian one almost everywhere, complete horizontal RV fibres and actual opposite-order standard contractions. The positioning image equals the labelled head projection. Compatible unary preparations are constructed in one genuine small containing context. Specified contractions in either order reduce to constructed contractions of their corresponding translated family with original-Gamma forward volume blowup chains and the same literal retained density. BalancedRows is the explicit balanced subcase, not a proof that all cells are balanced. The full global RV-volume comparison between the two translated families, the family case partition, higher-dimensional exchange and7.8-7.15 remain open.",
